<title>SRI LANKA: Lanka Orix up on foreign buying.</title>
<headline>Lanka Orix up on foreign buying.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lanka Orix Leasing Ltd rose 3.3 percent, or four rupees to 125, on turnover of 500 shares, brokers said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;There is foreign buying interest, because the share offers good value at current levels,&quot; said a broker.</p>
<p>LOLC rose to over 300 rupees when the market rallied in early 1994.</p>
<p>The share is very illiquid and the slightest buying pushes up the price, the broker said. --Colombo newsroom (41) 434319</p>
</text>
